Third-party material

This repository and its fixture release assets (fixtures-1, fixtures-2)
contain data derived from flyvis (https://github.com/TuragaLab/flyvis),
version 1.2.0:

  - crates/flyvis/src/pretrained.rs   trained parameters of model 000,
                                      generated by tools/export_params.py
  - crates/flyvis/src/groundtruth.rs  transcribed from
                                      flyvis/utils/groundtruth_utils.py,
                                      commit 9a51668
  - release assets, in flyvis-fixtures.tar.gz:
      flyvis-build/                   (fixtures-1, fixtures-2)
      flyvis-stimuli/                 (fixtures-1, fixtures-2)
      flyvis-reference/               (fixtures-2)
      flyvis-pretrained/ensemble.csv  (fixtures-2)

